Package: luci-app-glfanctl
Version: 1.0.7-1
Depends: luci, luci-compat, rpcd
Architecture: aarch64_cortex-a53_neon-vfpv4
Section: luci
Priority: optional
Title: Fan Control for GL-BE3600
Maintainer: local
Description: Custom fan policy daemon with LuCI page for the GL-BE3600 PWM fan. Supports OEM PID, temperature curve, fixed PWM and stop modes; restores the original gl_fan service on disable.
